  ID 9 
  POROSITY 0.2 
  TORTUOSITY 1 
  CHARACTERISTIC_CURVES cc1 
  PERMEABILITY
  PERM_X 1.052632e-15 
  PERM_Y 1.052632e-15 
  PERM_Z 1.052632e-16 
  /
